    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847360/extras/6a0c96a480097d3ac76d014e67f44be9.avif?t=1719900710\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br>Step into the vast unknown in &quot;Extinction&quot;, a gripping space exploration game where your survival depends on exploring alien planets and gathering essential resources. Play solo or join forces with friends in multiplayer mode, navigating the cosmos and uncovering the secrets of distant worlds.<br><br>Your spaceship is your sanctuary and your survival tool. Keeping its systems operational is crucial. Key systems you must manage include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Generator: Powers all essential systems aboard your ship. Regular maintenance and resource allocation are necessary to avoid power failures.<br></li><li> Respirator: Ensures life support for you and your crew. Keep it functioning to prevent suffocation and maintain a habitable environment on your ship.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847360/extras/2b60776a90ac338d0b8be479b6a45202.avif?t=1719900710\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br>Join my discord server, help improve the game, find people to play with, and get teasers for future updates now!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847360/extras/6a0c96a480097d3ac76d014e67f44be9.avif?t=1719900710\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br>Step into the vast unknown in &quot;Extinction&quot;, a gripping space exploration game where your survival depends on exploring alien planets and gathering essential resources. Play solo or join forces with friends in multiplayer mode, navigating the cosmos and uncovering the secrets of distant worlds.<br><br>Your spaceship is your sanctuary and your survival tool. Keeping its systems operational is crucial. Key systems you must manage include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Generator: Powers all essential systems aboard your ship. Regular maintenance and resource allocation are necessary to avoid power failures.<br></li><li> Respirator: Ensures life support for you and your crew. Keep it functioning to prevent suffocation and maintain a habitable environment on your ship.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847360/extras/2b60776a90ac338d0b8be479b6a45202.avif?t=1719900710\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br>Join my discord server, help improve the game, find people to play with, and get teasers for future updates now!<br><br>",
